





AGENTIC ST-T1024: CONFORMANCE

Normative Conformance Requirements for the Inter-Organizational Layer (A11–A16)

Status: Draft v0.1 — for circulation and critique
Companion to: AGENTIC ST-T1024: From Certified Agency to Inter-Organizational Admission
Prerequisites: ST-T1024 core; Agentic extension A0–A10; ACC concrete case
